  "releaseNotes": "1.10.0: Add multi-client server hosting with per-connection codecs, targeted sends, bounded broadcasts, connection limits and graceful shutdown. Preserve existing client APIs and packet trace constructors. Include English/Korean server guides and .NET 8/10 package verification. Includes documented Modbus/PLC enhancements, TLS, bounded MQTT/OPC UA subscriptions, secure OPC UA options and .NET 8 support for Modbus/MQTT/OPC UA.",
